  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Pig?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/30/Pig.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025201248\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Pig</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 10 • 18 • 32</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 500 • 1,400 • 2,300</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Bacon</span><span title=\"Bacon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193433\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 4 h</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Pigs</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> that produce <a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bacon</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 10. They are the third type of farm animal unlocked in the game.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3APig.png\" title=\"Pig.png (126 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/30/Pig.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025201248\" title=\"Pig.png (126 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Pig\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig.png (126 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Pig\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Pig</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Smiling.png\" title=\"Pig Smiling.png (137 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pig_Smiling.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025201408\" title=\"Pig Smiling.png (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Smiling.png (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Full.png\" title=\"Pig Full.png (157 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f7/Pig_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025201257\" title=\"Pig Full.png (157 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Pig Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Full.png (157 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Pig Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Pig Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Steaming.png\" title=\"Pig Steaming.png (338 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b1/Pig_Steaming.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20260514211727\" title=\"Pig Steaming.png (338 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Pig Steaming\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Steaming.png (338 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Pig Steaming\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Pig Steaming</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Waving.png\" title=\"Pig Waving.png (132 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Pig_Waving.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025201420\" title=\"Pig Waving.png (132 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Pig Waving\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Waving.png (132 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Pig Waving\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Pig Waving</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Hungry.png\" title=\"Pig Hungry.png (127 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Pig_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025201310\" title=\"Pig Hungry.png (127 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Pig Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Hungry.png (127 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Pig Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Pig Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Summer.png\" title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a0/Pig_Summer.png/revision/latest?cb=20130711082148\" title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Summer Pig\" height=\"128\" width=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Summer.png (78 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Summer Pig\" height=\"128\" width=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Summer Pig</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APig_Winter.png\" title=\"Pig Winter.png (523 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b2/Pig_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20260530212043\" title=\"Pig Winter.png (523 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Winter Pig\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig Winter.png (523 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Winter Pig\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Winter Pig</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Pigs wear themed clothes and accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Pig_Pen.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A pig pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A pig pen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A pig pen</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Pigs must be placed in <a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pig pens</a> to be purchased. Pens cost 150 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. They are unlocked at levels 10, 18 and 32. Each pen can house five pigs.\n</p><p>At level 10, pigs cost 500 coins each; at level 18, 1,400 coins; at level 32, 2,300 coins.\n</p><p>Pigs and pig pens can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.<span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Pig_Steamer.png/revision/latest?cb=20260513194646\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Steamer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Steamer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"173\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Steamer</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Bacon can be steamed from pigs every 4 hours. Players can skip the wait by paying 7 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> per pig. Players must then give pigs <a href=\"/wiki/pig-feed-2094\" title=\"Pig Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pig feed</a> to get another harvest. The bacon from the pigs are used to make many products, and to feed dogs and puppies.\n</p><p>Pig feed is made of:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Making pig feed only takes 20 minutes for 3 units. You can easily harvest all your bacon and replenish your feed stock by the time the pigs are fat again.</li>\n<li>Getting many pigs is recommended, because they are used to feed <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-dogs-7570\" title=\"Category:Dogs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dogs</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-puppies-18403\" title=\"Category:Puppies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">puppies</a> . &#160;</li>\n<li>Bacon can sometimes be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>, but sells very quickly,&#160;as it is also needed to feed dogs, as said above</li>\n<li>Feeding farm animals and harvesting bacon are common tasks in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Easter egg</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Tapping the pig pen makes the pigs stand up and wave hello.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Domesticated pigs are also called <em>swine</em>.</li>\n<li>In real life pork must be treated to become bacon.</li>\n<li>Pigs don't sweat!</li>\n<li>Despite stereotypes, pigs are actually very clean animals.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/la